WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
It seems that Senior Brother Xu won again this time

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,180
What a fool

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,340
A piece of broken cake

4
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,340
Is it worth a piece of meat and firestone?

5
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,340
Senior Brother Song

6
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,340
There is no right or wrong in academic argumentation

7
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,340
Don’t care too much about winning or losing

8
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,340
If there is no victory or defeat

9
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,340
Then what's the point of arguing?

10
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:21,020
Senior Brother Xu

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,020
Let's compete again

12
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,020
Just bet on what's in this kid's package

13
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:26,560
If it's clothes

14
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,560
He should wear a jade-colored chain

15
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,560
If it's food

16
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,560
Why rush for Shaobing?

17
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,560
I can't guess

18
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:34,580
This place is only ten miles away from Baisi Town

19
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,580
Bet on the heavy snow

20
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Why is he traveling alone?

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,580
In my opinion

22
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,580
He must have stolen some treasure in the last town.

23
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:41,580
Then he escaped through the night regardless of the wind and snow.

24
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,580
Senior Brother Song is very strict

25
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,580
Just guessing without evidence

26
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,580
Too abrupt

27
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,580
Junior Sister Lu

28
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:47,580
Even you look down on me

29
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,580
Isn't it

30
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,670
You will know at a glance

31
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,670
Boy stop

32
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:53,670
Unwrap you and let me see

33
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:57,040
stop you

34
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,040
Can't you hear it?

35
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:03,370
Unpack the package for me

36
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:36,860
Still in front of Junior Sister Lu
